424 | orchards | Gilbert orchard (species not known) | - | 1863-07 | conflict | An orchard of unknown species occupied the field south of McClean Grove on the Gilbert outlot (Gilbert Field #1), while the report elsewhere places the apple orchard in the northern outlot next to the McClean farm | At the time of the battle, an orchard (species not known) occupied the field >>> (Gilbert Field #1).
